WEBVTT

00:14:28.246 --> 00:14:32.204
except when compared to all the others."

00:14:32.246 --> 00:14:35.037
Democracy is messy and hard,

00:14:35.079 --> 00:14:37.454
and what we have now

00:14:37.496 --> 00:14:42.454
is messy, hard and bad results,

00:14:42.496 --> 00:14:44.371
really bad results.

00:14:44.412 --> 00:14:51.371
With final-five voting we'll have messy,
hard and good results to show for it.

00:14:52.954 --> 00:14:56.287
And perhaps the most
amazing part of all of this,

00:14:56.329 --> 00:15:00.954
final-five voting
is powerful and achievable.